{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"Evernote.Evernote","latestVersion":"11.41.9","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.bda37549.png","priority":1,"sha256":"bda3754985ab6a52fc4247c795b9d48c4d6732c44dc0d9401ca34cf42e9b640a","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Evernote Corporation","copyright":"© 2019 - 2026 Evernote Corporation. All rights reserved.","copyrightUrl":"https://evernote.com/legal/trademark-use","description":"Remember everything and tackle any project with your notes, tasks, and schedule all in one place.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://evernote.com/legal/terms-of-service","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Evernote Corporation","copyright":"© 2019 - 2026 Evernote Corporation. All rights reserved.","copyrightUrl":"https://evernote.com/legal/trademark-use","description":"Remember everything and tackle any project with your notes, tasks, and schedule all in one place.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://evernote.com/legal/terms-of-service","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Evernote helps you focus on what matters most and have access to your information when you need it. Input typed notes or scan handwritten notes. Add to-do’s, photos, images, web pages, or audio ... and it’s all instantly searchable. Organize notes any way you want and share with anyone. And Evernote syncs across your devices so your information is always with you, everywhere you go.","moniker":"evernote","name":"Evernote","packageUrl":"https://evernote.com/download","privacyUrl":"https://evernote.com/privacy/policy","publisher":"Evernote Corporation","publisherSupportUrl":"https://help.evernote.com/","publisherUrl":"https://evernote.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://evernote.com/compare-plans","releaseNotes":"✨ Features:\n- Tables get a new style menu: select non adjacent cells with Cmd/Ctrl, select the whole table with Cmd/Ctrl+A when a cell is focused, and align text in cells.\n- Click an empty slot in the Day or Week view in Calendar to create a 30 minute event.\n- The inline toolbar's More options menu now has a search field to find any formatting action.\n- In note edits proposed by the AI Assistant are now clearer: choose to see only the original text, only the changed text, or both, with changes highlighted word by word instead of large red and green blocks.\n- MCP can now read internal links, such as header links.\n\n🛠️ Fixes:\n- On Evernote Web, the browser tab now shows the open note's title.\n- Completed reminders in the note list now appear greyed out.\n- PDF, print, and HTML export now respect the strikethrough checklist setting.\n- Dates now follow your relative dates setting as soon as the app starts.\n- Fixes on Template imports and Meeting detection\n- Transcription made more reliable","tags":["9wzdncrfj3mb","ai-assistant","artificial-intelligence-assistant","calendar","checklist","collaborate","collaboration","list","memo","memorandum","notes","schedule","task","to-do","todo"]},"zh-CN":{"copyright":"© 2019 - 2026 Evernote Corporation。保留所有权利。","description":"在一处记住所有内容，并通过笔记、任务和日程处理一切。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Evernote 可帮助您专注于最重要的事情，并在需要时获取信息。输入打字笔记或扫描手写笔记，添加待办事项、照片、图片、网页或音频……并且所有内容都可即时搜索。以任何方式组织笔记，并与任何人共享。Evernote 还能在您的设备间同步，让你的信息随时随地与你同在。","tags":["任务","列表","协作","协同","备忘","备忘录","待办","待办事项","提醒事项","日历","日程","清单","笔记"]}},"longDescription":"Evernote helps you focus on what matters most and have access to your information when you need it. Input typed notes or scan handwritten notes. Add to-do’s, photos, images, web pages, or audio ... and it’s all instantly searchable. Organize notes any way you want and share with anyone. And Evernote syncs across your devices so your information is always with you, everywhere you go.","moniker":"evernote","name":"Evernote","packageUrl":"https://evernote.com/download","privacyUrl":"https://evernote.com/privacy/policy","publisher":"Evernote Corporation","publisherSupportUrl":"https://help.evernote.com/","publisherUrl":"https://evernote.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://evernote.com/compare-plans","releaseNotes":"✨ Features:\n- Tables get a new style menu: select non adjacent cells with Cmd/Ctrl, select the whole table with Cmd/Ctrl+A when a cell is focused, and align text in cells.\n- Click an empty slot in the Day or Week view in Calendar to create a 30 minute event.\n- The inline toolbar's More options menu now has a search field to find any formatting action.\n- In note edits proposed by the AI Assistant are now clearer: choose to see only the original text, only the changed text, or both, with changes highlighted word by word instead of large red and green blocks.\n- MCP can now read internal links, such as header links.\n\n🛠️ Fixes:\n- On Evernote Web, the browser tab now shows the open note's title.\n- Completed reminders in the note list now appear greyed out.\n- PDF, print, and HTML export now respect the strikethrough checklist setting.\n- Dates now follow your relative dates setting as soon as the app starts.\n- Fixes on Template imports and Meeting detection\n- Transcription made more reliable","tags":["9wzdncrfj3mb","ai-assistant","artificial-intelligence-assistant","calendar","checklist","collaborate","collaboration","list","memo","memorandum","notes","schedule","task","to-do","todo"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/11.41.9/app.json","detailSha256":"76e89144a2cd1a6cf8c82d032bdb65673366539997cece2291889ee7ecf39ee2","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"11.41.9"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/11.41.7/app.json","detailSha256":"8312c83b8b5c5ebd823a7dfb7f1f74de4064319a5b61722cd4ae5ae51a7ed253","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"11.41.7"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/11.40.3/app.json","detailSha256":"da654082765f899f2e87d49f44df6ceb5eb91f0b08e1eaea048c411fd9899